# novadeck: enable the power-key wake/suspend/power agent on release. /etc/machine-id is empty on a
# fresh image so systemd runs preset-all on first boot, where the stock 99-default.preset is
# "disable *"; this higher-priority preset (60 < 99) keeps the agent enabled. A build-time
# multi-user.target.wants symlink ships alongside as a fallback (cf. inputplumber's 60-novadeck).
enable novadeck-waked.service
